(a) the quantum of wool procured, tested and processed with support of the Integrated Wool Development Programme (IWDP) in Himachal Pradesh, State/UT-wise comparative data, during the last three years;
(b) the funds allocated and released for wool growers and processing infrastructure in Himachal Pradesh under IWDP, during the said period, year-wise;
(c) whether any proposal(s) from Himachal Pradesh for wool processing, testing or dehairing infrastructure is/are pending with the Ministry, if so, the details and current status thereof; and
(d) the reasons for delay, if any, attributable to the State Government, and the corrective measures being taken?

(a) the present status of construction of the Daulatpur Chowk-Kartoli-Talwara and Talwara-Mukerian sections of the Nangal Dam-Talwara-Mukerian new rail line project, including the percentage of bridge, viaduct and station building works completed;
(b) the funds allocated and released by the Central Government for these sections during the last three years, year-wise;
(c) the anticipated timeline for completion and commissioning of the balance sections; and
(d) the expected benefits to passenger and freight connectivity in Himachal Pradesh's Una district upon completion?

(a) the details of ropeway projects proposed or sanctioned in Himachal Pradesh under the National Ropeways Development Programme (Parvatmala);
(b) the details of funds allocated and released for these projects, year-wise;
(c) whether any proposal(s) from Himachal Pradesh under Parvatmala is/are pending with the Central Government and if so, the details and current status thereof; and
(d) the reasons for delay, if any, in according approval/completion and the corrective measures being taken?

(a) the current status of Earthquake Early Warning (EEW) system for the North-West Himalayas and whether Himachal Pradesh is covered under it, district-wise;
(b) the funds allocated and released for this purpose during the last three years;
(c) the current status and expected completion timeline of seismic microzonation studies for Sundernagar, Una, Palampur, Shimla, Kangra and Dharamshala; and
(d) the reasons for delay, if any, in completing these microzonation studies, and the corrective measures being taken therefor?

(a) the literacy rate, particularly female literacy rate, among Scheduled Tribes in Himachal Pradesh as per the latest available details and how it compares with the State and National averages;
(b) the number of schools and educational institutions functional in the tribal blocks of Kinnaur, Lahaul-Spiti, Pangi and Bharmour and the funds allocated and released for educational infrastructure in these areas, year-wise, during the last three years;
(c) whether any special schemes exist to improve female literacy and school enrolment among tribal communities in border areas and if so, the details thereof; and
(d) the steps being taken to address gaps, if any, in educational outcomes in these areas?

